{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "背书与排序",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 104.06,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看 Hyperledger Fabric。",
   "spoken": "先看 Hyperledger Fabric。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.952,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "它的一笔交易，要过三道关，执行，排序，验证。",
   "spoken": "它的一笔交易，要过三道关，执行，排序，验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.772,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 4.87,
   "speechEnd": 9.62
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "第一关，几家组织的背书节点，模拟执行链码，签下读写集。",
   "spoken": "第一关，几家组织的背书节点，模拟执行链码，签下读写集。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.656,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 10.754,
   "speechEnd": 15.968
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "第二关，排序服务只决定顺序，不判断业务对不对。",
   "spoken": "第二关，排序服务只决定顺序，不判断业务对不对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.02,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 17.118,
   "speechEnd": 20.939
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "第三关，记账节点不重新执行，只核对背书策略和读集的版本。",
   "spoken": "第三关，记账节点不重新执行，只核对背书策略和读集的版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.992,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 22.09,
   "speechEnd": 27.78
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "被拒绝的交易仍然留在区块里，只是标成无效。",
   "spoken": "被拒绝的交易仍然留在区块里，只是标成无效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.836,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 28.934,
   "speechEnd": 32.826
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "背书策略规定，一笔交易需要哪些组织签名。",
   "spoken": "背书策略规定，一笔交易需要哪些组织签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.88,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 33.978,
   "speechEnd": 37.43
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "默认要求通道成员的多数。",
   "spoken": "默认要求通道成员的多数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.492,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 38.59,
   "speechEnd": 40.53
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "要是写成任一组织都行，就等于让一家成员单独决定写入。",
   "spoken": "要是写成任一组织都行，就等于让一家成员单独决定写入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 41.592,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 41.69,
   "speechEnd": 46.511
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "排序服务也要按威胁来选。",
   "spoken": "排序服务也要按威胁来选。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.572,
   "dur": 2.928,
   "speechStart": 47.67,
   "speechEnd": 49.67
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "Raft 是崩溃容错，5 个节点能容忍 2 个宕机，却不防恶意节点。",
   "spoken": "Raft 是崩溃容错，5 个节点能容忍 2 个宕机，却不防恶意节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.72,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 50.818,
   "speechEnd": 55.591
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "一家运营方的排序节点被攻破，它伪造不了背书，却能决定顺序，延迟或丢弃交易。",
   "spoken": "一家运营方的排序节点被攻破，它伪造不了背书，却能决定顺序，延迟或丢弃交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 56.652,
   "dur": 7.536,
   "speechStart": 56.75,
   "speechEnd": 63.345
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "成员之间互不信任，就选 BFT，并把节点分给不同的运营方。",
   "spoken": "成员之间互不信任，就选 BFT，并把节点分给不同的运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 64.408,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 64.506,
   "speechEnd": 68.958
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "再看隐私。",
   "spoken": "再看隐私。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 70.028,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 70.126,
   "speechEnd": 70.84
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "私有数据集合，只把原文发给部分组织，账本上只留哈希。",
   "spoken": "私有数据集合，只把原文发给部分组织，账本上只留哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 72.12,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 72.218,
   "speechEnd": 77.099
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "假设集合里存着客户等级，一共只有三档。",
   "spoken": "假设集合里存着客户等级，一共只有三档。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 78.148,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 78.246,
   "speechEnd": 81.722
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "圈外的组织，算出三个哈希一比，就知道了。",
   "spoken": "圈外的组织，算出三个哈希一比，就知道了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 82.76,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 82.858,
   "speechEnd": 86.143
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "所以低熵的数据要加随机盐，输入走 transient 字段，不放进普通参数。",
   "spoken": "所以低熵的数据要加随机盐，输入走 transient 字段，不放进普通参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 87.18,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 87.278,
   "speechEnd": 92.956
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "链码本身也必须确定。",
   "spoken": "链码本身也必须确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 94.024,
   "dur": 2.496,
   "speechStart": 94.122,
   "speechEnd": 95.681
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "读本地时间或随机数，各个节点算出的结果不同，交易就过不了背书。",
   "spoken": "读本地时间或随机数，各个节点算出的结果不同，交易就过不了背书。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
